      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MILOLA ROCK (7) was disappointing last start when after racing roughly in the score up finished eighth over 2190m at Maryborough after a nice fourth at Charlton the run prior. Has to contend with a very wide draw. Meets a similar line up and she can figure in the finish. BETTING ATTACK (4) was without a win before he improved last start to score at long odds by a nose over 2190m at Maryborough a week ago when after leading early raced in behind the leader at the bell, then used the sprint lane. His last-start form is good enough to take this race out. MARGARITARI (6) is in the mix following a fourth at her most recent appearance over 1710m at Ballarat. FRANKIE UNDER FIRE (5) cannot be left out after solid recent performances, the latest a sound third at Terang over 1680m after having raced four-back on the fence at the bell.",
